    },
    {
      "text": "Divide cabbage among 4 squares of aluminum foil. Sprinkle 2 tablespoons soy sauce over each cabbage mound; place 1 tablespoon butter on top. Season with pepper. Fold the sides of the foil over cabbage, sealing to form a packet.",
